I'm thinking about applying CSS animation to the `.picture-panel`, which appears in both the StoryPlayer and Replay, but I want to avoid affecting thumbnails. I could target the direct children of images and SVGs with a specific data class. For the StoryPlayer, I could add `className="picture-panel motion-stage"` to enable this class, but I wonder if the Replay should stay static or if it could also incorporate the same class for consistency."}]}

